# This file is a template only — safe to commit, contains no real values.
# Real secrets are NOT set via .env files for this project. They're stored
# in Google Secret Manager via `firebase functions:secrets:set`, which is
# the correct place for anything as sensitive as an API client secret.
#
# To set the real Kroger credentials (run these yourself, in your own
# terminal — never paste secret values into chat):
#
#   firebase functions:secrets:set KROGER_CLIENT_ID
#   firebase functions:secrets:set KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET
#
# Each command prompts you to paste the value directly into the terminal;
# it's encrypted at rest and only readable by this Cloud Function at runtime.
